        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dark yellow-green satin ground, brocaded with polychrome silks and gold and silver yarns. Parts of two vertical repeats of a fanciful chinoiserie design showing natural and fantastic blossoms, arches, capitals and a pseudo-chinese figure leaning over a balustrade. A few very small holes. Black silks gone in a few places. Part of a selvedge."@en ;
